    "updated_at": "2024-03-05T08:46:09Z",
    "body": "I don't think I suggested that the `div` element in that example should be false? Just that `<input disabled>` should be.\r\n\r\nAnyway, my further point was that if we are not going to take into account `<input disabled>` in the API, why even say something about it?",
